troller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1136380","steamName":"Ultimate Fishing® Simulator 2","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1136380/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:47:25.692288+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Fish around the globe using float, bottom, spinning, or casting gear, and catch over 60 realistic fish species. Play solo or online in normal, realistic, or sandbox mode! Explore stunning locations, switch to an underwater cam, and fill your trophy room!","detailedDescription":"Choose between float, bottom, spinning, and casting methods. Use hundreds of items, customize your gear, and adapt your approach based on weather, time of day, and fish behavior. With an improved underwater camera system, functional sonar, and controller support, every moment is immersive and responsive.\n\n \n\nTravel to diverse locations across the globe, from peaceful lakes to powerful coastal waters. Play solo or with others in multiplayer. Tackle tournaments, complete daily quests, or relax in sandbox mode where everything is unlocked from the start. For those who seek more challenge, the realistic mode strips away all assists for a truly demanding experience.\n\nFrom tiny roach to massive tiger sharks, Ultimate Fishing Simulator 2 features a wide variety of fish across freshwater and saltwater locations. Each species is brought to life with natural animations, authentic behaviors, and realistic size and weight variation. Some are cautious and elusive, others are aggressive and put up a serious fight - every catch is a unique encounter.\n\nKey Features\n\n• \nFloat, bottom, spinning, and casting fishing styles\n\n• \n60+ fish species with realistic behavior and fight mechanics\n\n• \nUnderwater camera view\n\n• \nSingleplayer and multiplayer\n\n• \nTrophy Room with aquariums to showcase your best catches\n\n• \nGlobal locations, including lakes, rivers, canals, and tropical coasts\n\n• \nWide range of fishing gear\n\n• \nController support with vibration feedback\n\n• \nDaily quests, tournaments, and ranking events\n\n• \n Multiple difficulty modes, including normal, realistic, and SANDBOX","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/header.jpg?t=1788519219"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788519219"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_05692f4c476cc6e0b3580424d3f4768bffbb122a.600x338.jpg?t=1788519219","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_05692f4c476cc6e0b3580424d3f4768bffbb122a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788519219"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_67549c439148c037c6a249aaa8decfb72352aba5.600x338.jpg?t=1788519219","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_67549c439148c037c6a249aaa8decfb72352aba5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788519219"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_2463a9045d1a1141f322dfe20d846cf4f689c4bb.600x338.jpg?t=1788519219","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_2463a9045d1a1141f322dfe20d846cf4f689c4bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788519219"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_3996dd55bd4bf0a7ee7d5551d51bc9b60ec4d238.600x338.jpg?t=1788519219","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136380/ss_3996dd